    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__GeneralSettings__c records where SBQQ__TriggerDisabled__c = true.
Why it matters: ALL CPQ managed-package triggers are disabled — quote calc, subscription creation, renewal logic, and order activation all stop working. A complete CPQ outage that can persist for days if nobody notices.
Suppress a finding: only during a known maintenance window of &lt; 24 hours.
Disable the detector: never. This is one of the most-critical org-level checks.</value></values>
